**/[Bb]in/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Dd]ebug/
**/[Rr]elease/
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.rsuser
*.suo
TestResults/
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
artifacts/
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

# Secrets and local configuration — never commit real values;
# configuration arrives through environment variables (see SECURITY.md)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
appsettings.*.local.json

# A library does not commit a lock file: consumers resolve the
# declared PackageReference ranges against their own graph. The CI
# security job generates one transiently for scanning.
packages.lock.json
